{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026G25sY9dqMJ1793699753.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>黃婉瑩Annie在《睇餸食飯》中所示範的時令家常菜式——「簡易版豬手薑醋」的詳細食譜。這道菜製作簡單，最適合在天氣轉涼時品嚐。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"755a933a-4fe3-4a14-9da4-00d9045db80d.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026FaJhAfaX3V1793699753.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><h4>材料</h4><ul><li><p>豬手：2隻</p></li><li><p>大肉薑：2斤</p></li><li><p>雞蛋：6隻</p></li></ul><h4>調味</h4><ul><li><p>甜醋：2升</p></li><li><p>白米醋：2湯匙</p></li><li><p>鹽：2茶匙</p></li><li><p>油：2湯匙</p></li></ul><h4>做法</h4><ol><li><p>肉薑削皮後拍鬆，放入白鑊中並撒鹽烘出水分，加油兜炒。</p></li><li><p>豬手放入鑊內汆水，盛起沖水，備用。</p></li><li><p>煲滾一鍋水，加薑頭薑尾、白醋，放入豬手煮20分鐘。</p></li><li><p>另準備一鍋甜醋，加入(1)兜炒過的薑、(3)豬手，合蓋煮50至60分鐘，加雞蛋再煮10分鐘，關火後浸一晚，即可享用。</p></li></ol></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:02:20.158660+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":247,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:31.597800+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:59:17.078568+00:00","content_hash":"90dd4dc6830d37837b1df34e8473665be762d6f57b2037a0922fc90af5111e1b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}